                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.C112/1345: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-05-11T19:00:00+01:00">May 11, 1938—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 11—2:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1091. Reference 1090, January 29, 11 a.m. The Council today decided that the
                    Bureau should meet during the session of the Assembly in September, the exact
                    date to be fixed by the Secretary General.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
